  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fBotany\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b74a68ba-7878-4f63-8939-7763bd641272.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cgMBVMV.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"193\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>包含着色器。感谢“Iris”模组及EMINGTR制作的“Complementary”。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong>部分重要特性：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>✔️ 精选200+模组，注重模组间交互与协同</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>⭐ Starmute的Terralith、Incendium、Nullscape、Continents<br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>🔥 Better Nether 与 Better End、暮色森林<br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>🍂 Botany的Lush Leaves、Structory、Fancy GUI<br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span s